{"id":"45624dd0d412f2de","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-logic9-tameness-property.md","title":"ZFC Logic9 Tameness Property","display":"df-zfc-logic9-tameness-property — ZFC Logic9 Tameness Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic9-tameness-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic9-tameness-property"],"display":"df-zfc-logic9-tameness-property — ZFC Logic9 Tameness Property","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-logic9-abstract-elementary-class.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-logic9-galois-type.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-model6-monster-model.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic9-tameness-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-tameness-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic9-tameness-property — ZFC Logic9 Tameness Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25b9260c94f77a3a\" href=\"?note=25b9260c94f77a3a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-logic9-abstract-elementary-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-logic9-abstract-elementary-class.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b866d5d6df9ca9cd\" href=\"?note=b866d5d6df9ca9cd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-logic9-galois-type.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-logic9-galois-type.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b8a222a3f137d166\" href=\"?note=b8a222a3f137d166\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-model6-monster-model.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-model6-monster-model.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},\\kappa,L,\\mathfrak C,\\lambda,M,N,p,q\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},\\kappa,L,\\mathfrak C,\\lambda,M,N,p,q\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9GaloisType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9GaloisType}_S\\)</span> 的参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p,a,M,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},\\lambda,L)\">\\((p,a,M,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},\\lambda,L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 是源定义的巨模型界。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Aut}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Aut}_S\\)</span> 取 Galois 型依赖链中的定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|N|\">\\(|N|\\)</span> 在此表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathrm{Univ}(N)|\">\\(|\\mathrm{Univ}(N)|\\)</span>，不是结构编码本身的基数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GaloisTypes}_S(M,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},\\lambda,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{GaloisTypes}_S(M,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},\\lambda,L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GaloisRestrict}_S(p,N,\\mathfrak C,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{GaloisRestrict}_S(p,N,\\mathfrak C,L)\\)</span> 为下式定义的集合函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},\\lambda,L)\">\\((\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},\\lambda,L)\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{gS}_{\\mathfrak C}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{gS}_{\\mathfrak C}(M)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\upharpoonright N\">\\(p\\upharpoonright N\\)</span> 分别为这两个显式函数的简称。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AbstractElementaryClass}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AbstractElementaryClass}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"25b9260c94f77a3a\" href=\"?note=25b9260c94f77a3a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-logic9-abstract-elementary-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-logic9-abstract-elementary-class.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6MonsterModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6MonsterModel}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b8a222a3f137d166\" href=\"?note=b8a222a3f137d166\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-model6-monster-model.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-model6-monster-model.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9TamenessProperty}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9TamenessProperty}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GaloisTypes}_S(M,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},\\lambda,L)\\coloneqq\n\\{p\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak C)):\\exists a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak C)\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9GaloisType}_S(p,a,M,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},\\lambda,L)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GaloisTypes}_S(M,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},\\lambda,L)\\coloneqq\n\\{p\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak C)):\\exists a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak C)\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9GaloisType}_S(p,a,M,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},\\lambda,L)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GaloisRestrict}_S(p,N,\\mathfrak C,L)\\coloneqq\n\\{b\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak C):\\exists a\\in p\\cap\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak C)\\;\\exists f\\in V\\;(\n\\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,\\mathfrak C,L)\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\\;(f(m)=m)\\land f(a)=b)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GaloisRestrict}_S(p,N,\\mathfrak C,L)\\coloneqq\n\\{b\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak C):\\exists a\\in p\\cap\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak C)\\;\\exists f\\in V\\;(\n\\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,\\mathfrak C,L)\\land\n\\forall m\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(N)\\;(f(m)=m)\\land f(a)=b)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9TamenessProperty}_S(\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists L,\\mathfrak C,\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AbstractElementaryClass}_S(\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},L)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel6MonsterModel}_S(\\mathcal K,\\mathfrak C,\\lambda,L)\\land\n\\forall M\\in\\mathcal K\\;(\\langle M,\\mathfrak C\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathcal K})\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall p,q\\in\n\\mathrm{GaloisTypes}_S(M,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},\\lambda,L)\\;\n\\Bigl(p\\neq q\\to\\exists N\\in\\mathcal K\\;(\n\\langle N,M\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathcal K}\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(N)|&lt;\\kappa\\land\n\\mathrm{GaloisRestrict}_S(p,N,\\mathfrak C,L)\\neq\n\\mathrm{GaloisRestrict}_S(q,N,\\mathfrak C,L))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9TamenessProperty}_S(\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists L,\\mathfrak C,\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AbstractElementaryClass}_S(\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},L)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel6MonsterModel}_S(\\mathcal K,\\mathfrak C,\\lambda,L)\\land\n\\forall M\\in\\mathcal K\\;(\\langle M,\\mathfrak C\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathcal K})\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall M\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\forall p,q\\in\n\\mathrm{GaloisTypes}_S(M,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal K,\\leq_{\\mathcal K},\\lambda,L)\\;\n\\Bigl(p\\neq q\\to\\exists N\\in\\mathcal K\\;(\n\\langle N,M\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathcal K}\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(N)|&lt;\\kappa\\land\n\\mathrm{GaloisRestrict}_S(p,N,\\mathfrak C,L)\\neq\n\\mathrm{GaloisRestrict}_S(q,N,\\mathfrak C,L))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary type definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-logic9-abstract-elementary-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"25b9260c94f77a3a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends