rm{GaloisRestrict}_S(p,N,\\mathfrak C,L)\\neq\n\\mathrm{GaloisRestrict}_S(q,N,\\mathfrak C,L))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3314,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2502","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-logic9-tameness-property.md|58-df-zfc-logic9-tameness-property]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5fb1c2241d1943d1","25b9260c94f77a3a","b866d5d6df9ca9cd","b8a222a3f137d166"]}